# sabotage=PassesDropCalls: behind the pass a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass joins an await with the call that it awaits, a call of a known async function or of a built-in, and answers for those alone: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass ResolveAwaitedCalls
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-beside-an-await-left-alone.ir
